<Section collapsed="true" isCollapsible="true" drawButton="true" MultipleChoiceAnswerIndex="-1" MultipleChoiceRandomizeChoices="false" TrueFalseAnswerIndex="-1" EssayAnswerRows="5" EssayAnswerColumns="60"><Title><Text-field style="Heading 1" layout="Heading 1">Question 2 Lecture 8</Text-field></Title><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal"></Text-field>
<Group labelreference="L382" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
<Input><Text-field style="Normal" layout="Normal"><Font style="Text" bold="true">(a)</Font> The graph of the function <Equation executable="false" style="Normal" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>  has three vertical asymptotes at the three roots of the denominator.  Use solve to find the location of these three asymptotes and then graph the function using the option <Font style="Text" bold="true">discont = true</Font> to remove the vertical asymptotic lines. Choose horizontal as well as vertical ranges to give a nice picture of the curves. </Text-field><Text-field style="Normal" layout="Normal"></Text-field><Text-field style="Normal" layout="Normal"><Font style="Text" bold="true">(b)</Font> Plot the graph of the <Font style="Text" italic="true">Nephroid of Freeth</Font>,  the curve given <Font underline="true" style="Text">in polar coordinates</Font> by the equation <Equation executable="false" style="Text" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> .  Note that you will need to take <Equation executable="false" style="Normal" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEnJiM5NTI7RicvJSdpdGFsaWNHUSZmYWxzZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdub3JtYWxGJ0Yy">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEnJiM5NTI7RicvJSdpdGFsaWNHUSZmYWxzZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdub3JtYWxGJ0Yy</Equation> in the range 0 to <Equation executable="false" style="Normal" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> to get the right picture.</Text-field><Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal"></Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Section collapsed="true" isCollapsible="true" drawButton="true" MultipleChoiceAnswerIndex="-1" MultipleChoiceRandomizeChoices="false" TrueFalseAnswerIndex="-1" EssayAnswerRows="5" EssayAnswerColumns="60"><Title><Text-field style="Heading 2" layout="Heading 2">Answer</Text-field></Title>
<Group hide-input="false" labelreference="L824" drawlabel="true" applyint="true" applyrational="true" applyexponent="false">
